{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object is visible, approach and grab it. Then move to destination, check properties, perform task. Finally, scan area for object. list of available nodes: <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = MoveToDestination    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <Action ID = ScanAreaForObject    /> <SubTree ID = PerformTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectHeld    /> <Condition ID = IsDestinationReached    />",
